


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_31735373:


    "已经快过零点了。房间里已经熄灯，阳菜和文都进入了被窝。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_9582aa31:


    "然而，只有伦不在。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_90349947:



    voice "HIN_1433"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_8cc3d9a4:


    "阳菜辗转反侧。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_0ee7dccc:


    "门被轻轻打开，走廊里的灯光洒进了房间。来人的脚步声越来越近。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_413daadf:



    voice "RIN_1188"
    rin "「……已经睡了吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_11c96386:


    "伦半蹲在阳菜边，偷看阳菜的睡颜。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_51086ac8:


    "阳菜一动不动，没有回应。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_7a301e7b:



    voice "RIN_1189"
    rin "「……………」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_1c4d16ba:


    "伦露出幸福的微笑，伸出手，像是在确认阳菜的温暖一样，慢慢地抚弄着她的头发。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_c87b9f28:



    voice "RIN_1190"
    rin "「……晚安」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_bc377037:


    "伦亲吻了阳菜的脸颊，然后登上扶梯钻进被窝。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_34ea8635:



    voice "HIN_1434"
    hina "「……………」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_353628bd:


    "待到伦发出入眠的呼吸声，阳菜才朝墙壁翻了个身。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_9df8aff3:


    "她的脸已被泪水浸湿。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_cf591113:



    voice "HIN_1435"
    hina "「有烟味……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou2_07_d1fbc80f:


    "阳菜将脸埋进枕头里。"
